"N] "
msgid_plural ""
"Remove the %1 workboxes (%2)? Everything in them and in their volumes will "
"be lost. [y/N] "
msgstr[0] ""
"¿Eliminar el workbox %2? Se perderá todo lo que hay en él y en sus "
"volúmenes. [s/N] "
msgstr[1] ""
"¿Eliminar los %1 workboxes (%2)? Se perderá todo lo que hay en ellos y en "
"sus volúmenes. [s/N] "

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Removed the workbox %1."
msgstr "Se ha eliminado el workbox %1."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Removes a workbox and its home, stopping it first if it runs: everything in "
"them is lost. Asks for its id first, or with --all, for a yes, unless --"
"yes.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox rm c1"
msgstr ""
"Elimina un workbox y su carpeta personal, y antes lo detiene si está en "
"marcha: se pierde todo lo que contienen. Antes pide su id o, con --all, un "
"sí, salvo con --yes.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox rm c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Removing the workbox %1 (\"%2\") loses everything in it and in its home.\n"
"Type its id to remove it: "
msgstr ""
"Al eliminar el workbox %1 («%2») se pierde todo lo que hay en él y en su "
"carpeta personal.\n"
"Escribe su id para eliminarlo: "

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "column of workbox list"
msgid "STATUS"
msgstr "ESTADO"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Shows a workbox: its name, color, status, image and settings.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox info c1"
msgstr ""
"Muestra un workbox: su nombre, color, estado, imagen y ajustes.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox info c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Started the workbox %1."
msgstr "Se ha arrancado el workbox %1."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Starts a workbox.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox start c1"
msgstr ""
"Arranca un workbox.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox start c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Stopped the workbox %1."
msgstr "Se ha detenido el workbox %1."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops a workbox, or with --all every running one, and everything running in "
"them.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox stop c1"
msgstr ""
"Detiene un workbox, o con --all todos los que están en marcha, y todo lo que "
"se ejecuta en ellos.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox stop c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Sudo"
msgstr "Sudo"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "The name it's shown with (default: its id)."
msgstr "El nombre con el que se muestra (por defecto, su id)."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "The workbox %1 is already running."
msgstr "El workbox %1 ya está en marcha."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "The workbox %1 is already stopped."
msgstr "El workbox %1 ya está parado."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "The workbox's id."
msgstr "El id del workbox."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "There are no workboxes to remove."
msgstr "No hay workboxes que eliminar."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Usage: workbox <command> [options]\n"
"\n"
"Runs containers, each a separate place to work, that share nothing with the "
"host.\n"
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  create  Create a workbox\n"
"  list    List the workboxes\n"
"  info    Show a workbox\n"
"  start   Start a workbox\n"
"  stop    Stop a workbox\n"
"  enter   Open a shell in a workbox\n"
"  rm      Remove a workbox and its home\n"
"\n"
"\"workbox <command> --help\" shows a command's options; \"workbox --"
"version\", its version."
msgstr ""
"Uso: workbox <comando> [opciones]\n"
"\n"
"Ejecuta contenedores, cada uno un lugar de trabajo aparte, que no comparten "
"nada con el sistema.\n"
"\n"
"Comandos:\n"
"  create  Crea un workbox\n"
"  list    Lista los workboxes\n"
"  info    Muestra un workbox\n"
"  start   Arranca un workbox\n"
"  stop    Detiene un workbox\n"
"  enter   Abre un shell en un workbox\n"
"  rm      Elimina un workbox y su carpeta personal\n"
"\n"
"«workbox <comando> --help» muestra las opciones de un comando; «workbox --"
"version», su versión."

